<view class="page"><view class="brand-kicker">POSTURE CARE <text>DAILY</text></view><view class="hero-title">日常姿态提醒</view><view class="hero-sub">只做轻量提醒，不给孩子贴标签</view>
<view class="posture-hero"><view class="number">{{alerts}}</view><view><view class="strong">今日提醒次数</view><view class="small">提醒会在设备端即时出现，不保存原始视频</view></view></view>
<view class="section-title">提醒类型</view><view class="care-grid"><view class="care-card pink"><view class="icon">坐</view><view class="strong">坐姿提醒</view><view class="small muted">身体明显歪斜或坐姿持续不稳时轻声提醒</view></view><view class="care-card purple"><view class="icon">头</view><view class="strong">低头提醒</view><view class="small muted">长时间低头时，提醒抬头并活动颈肩</view></view><view class="care-card blue"><view class="icon">距</view><view class="strong">距离提醒</view><view class="small muted">距离设备过近时，提示后退到舒适范围</view></view></view>
<view class="section-title">提醒原则</view><view class="card principles"><view>• 只在明显且持续的情况下提醒</view><view>• 同一问题短时间内不重复打扰</view><view>• 家长可在设备页随时关闭该能力</view></view><view class="notice">姿态提醒是日常陪伴提示，不用于疾病诊断、治疗或专业体态评估。</view></view>
